":ref:`synchroniser_deux_machines`, :ref:`panneau_reference`, "
":ref:`lecons`, :ref:`diriger_un_tournoi`, :ref:`cli_transfer` et "
":ref:`headless`."
msgstr ""
"See :ref:`groupes_bibliotheques`, :ref:`vue_ailleurs`, "
":ref:`synchroniser_deux_machines`, :ref:`panneau_reference`, "
":ref:`lecons`, :ref:`diriger_un_tournoi`, :ref:`cli_transfer` and "
