":ref:`cli_openingbook`, :ref:`metrique_livre_ouverture` et "
":ref:`api_reference`."
msgstr ""
"See :ref:`panneau_entrainement`, :ref:`raccourcis`, "
":ref:`cli_openingbook`, :ref:`metrique_livre_ouverture` and "
